{
 "dur": 70.6,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.35,
   "chunks": [
    "What happens when computers",
    "start using human brains?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 4.06,
   "chunks": [
    "This is a biocomputer.",
    "And you see,",
    "those are real human neurons.",
    "Alive. On a chip."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 9.43,
   "chunks": [
    "Where from?",
    "Stem cells,",
    "grown into neurons on the chip."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 12.76,
   "chunks": [
    "Under them, a grid",
    "of 59 electrodes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 15.59,
   "chunks": [
    "The silicon talks to them.",
    "Pulses in.",
    "Spikes out."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 18.85,
   "chunks": [
    "But neurons need a body.",
    "So the box becomes one."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 21.91,
   "chunks": [
    "Pumps feed them.",
    "Filters pull out waste.",
    "Gas mixing lets them breathe.",
    "Heat keeps body temperature."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 27.89,
   "chunks": [
    "They live up to six months."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 29.6,
   "chunks": [
    "But can they learn?",
    "In 2022, about 800,000 neurons",
    "in a dish",
    "learned Pong."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 35.27,
   "chunks": [
    "Hit the ball?",
    "Predictable feedback.",
    "Miss? Random noise.",
    "They learned to rally."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 39.88,
   "chunks": [
    "That was DishBrain.",
    "Its successor, the CL1,",
    "sells for $35,000."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 45.35,
   "chunks": [
    "Or rent one.",
    "Swiss startup FinalSpark",
    "streams 16 living mini-brains",
    "online."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 50.51,
   "chunks": [
    "Why bother? Power.",
    "Your brain runs on",
    "about 20 watts.",
    "AI data centers draw",
    "hundreds of megawatts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 56.67,
   "chunks": [
    "FinalSpark claims",
    "a million times less energy.",
    "Not proven yet."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v15",
   "t": 60.87,
   "chunks": [
    "Of course,",
    "it can't think like you.",
    "Yet.",
    "But for the first time,",
    "a computer is grown, not built."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v16",
   "t": 66.57,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we take apart next?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}